# Pairs with EpochMonotonic. The grain persists nothing, so a re-activation must
# take a fresh incarnation; reusing the old one restarts the version at zero and
# an epoch silos have seen supersedes the new one.
MODULE: EpochRestartReusesIncarnation
TARGET: EpochMonotonic
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a re-activated epoch grain reuses the previous incarnation
PERTURBS: EpochRestart
BOUNDS: MaxRestarts = 1

--- FIND
    /\ epoch' = <<epoch[1] + 1, 0>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the incarnation is reused.
    /\ epoch' = <<epoch[1], 0>>
--- END
